<div class="page-header"><h1>Kitchen Cabinets in Montana</h1><p>From the booming Bozeman and Big Sky corridor to Whitefish, Missoula, and Billings, Montana homeowners and designers can spec the full Pinnacle Sales lineup — Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets — through independent local showrooms.</p></div>
