<h2 id="montana-kitchen-design-trends">Montana Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>Montana kitchens are defined by mountain-modern luxury: warm woods like knotty alder and rift oak, reclaimed textures, blackened metal, and clean lines that frame big mountain views. The Bozeman and Big Sky market in particular has drawn an influx of high-end residents who want contemporary cabinetry with natural warmth — pairing <a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh's</a> stain and paint program with <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> or handleless fronts for a refined, modern-rustic result.</p>
